------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GPU option (not distributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No GPU image is published. build/gateway-gpu.Dockerfile, which users build
themselves, starts from NVIDIA's nvidia/cuda CUDA 12 + cuDNN 9 runtime image
and adds ONNX Runtime's GPU build (MIT, Microsoft Corporation). Whoever
builds or runs that image accepts NVIDIA's terms for the CUDA and cuDNN
libraries in it (NVIDIA CUDA Toolkit EULA,
https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/eula/index.html; NVIDIA cuDNN Software License
Agreement,
https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/cudnn/latest/reference/eula.html).
Guard Spec's own releases contain no NVIDIA software.

