(eval/, see eval/LICENSES.md) and the training data (train/data/, see
train/DATA_LICENSES.md). Each row keeps its source and license fields.

deepset/prompt-injections
  deepset GmbH. Apache License 2.0 (the card also lists CC-BY-4.0).
